<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Bedava Günlük Kazançlar</title>

<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f2f2f2;
    text-align: center;
}

header {
    background: #111;
    color: white;
    padding: 35px 15px;
}

header h1 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 30px;
}

header p {
    margin: 0;
}

.container {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 25px auto;
    padding: 10px;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    margin: 20px 0;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
}

.card h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
}

.card p {
    color: #555;
}

.button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 13px 25px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    background: #0088cc;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

footer {
    background: #111;
    color: white;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-top: 30px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>💰 Bedava Günlük Kazançlar</h1>
    <p>Günlük kazanç fırsatlarını keşfet</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

    <div class="card">
        <h2>🪙 TronPick</h2>
        <p>TRON tabanlı platforma katıl.</p>
        <a class="button"
           href="https://tronpick.io/?ref=Brainfreei"
           target="_blank">
           Hemen Katıl
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>🐦 Birds Empire</h2>
        <p>Telegram üzerinden oyuna katıl.</p>
        <a class="button"
           href="https://t.me/BirdsEmpireBot?start=2109000"
           target="_blank">
           Telegram'da Aç
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>🤖 AI Lab</h2>
        <p>Yapay zekân senin için çalışsın — 7/24 kazan 👆</p>
        <a class="button"
           href="https://t.me/AiLab_robot?start=583981"
           target="_blank">
           Hemen Başla
        </a>
    </div>

</div>

<footer>
    © 2026 Bedava Günlük Kazançlar
</footer>

</body>
</html>
